plates.note:
Hands behind his head, stretching, in an Adirondack chair in the shade of a large tree, in the first video array where four copies of the same face each appear in a different room.

@bk2 The chair is the point rather than the garden. He materialises one inside Jacques's VR in Bk2 ch63 and Jacques notes it is a little anachronistic in there, but whatever.

@bk4 And it is inherited. Will has them seventy years later on a deck above a lake with Asgard hanging three times the size of the Moon, and by Bk4 ch66 he and Garfield are reclining in a pair of them with drinks balanced on their stomachs.
